==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Ghost Doge]]s spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Ghost Snache]]s spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Ghost Baa Baa]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Kitarou (Enemy)|Kitarou]] spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Zoge]]s spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
**5 [[Znache]]s spawn, delay 16.67~33.33 seconds<sup>500f~1,000f</sup>.
**5 [[Zroco]]s spawn, delay 16.67~33.33 seconds<sup>500f~1,000f</sup>.
**1 [[Neko-Musume (Enemy)|Neko-Musume]] spawns.
**1 [[Medama-Oyaji (Enemy)|Medama-Oyaji]] spawns.

==Strategy==
A rather difficult stage, all the collaboration enemies have high magnification giving rather high health (315,000 for Medama-Oyaji, 135,000 for Neko-Musume, and 153,000 for Kitatou). Good heavy hitters like [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] and good DPS units such as [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] and [[Figure Skating Cats (Super Rare Cat)|Drama Cats]] can help beat this stage. The peons aren't much of a threat due to being weak.

